Penumbra Panel

Based on COSMIC Panel and COSMIC Settings by System76 and their contributors.

COSMIC Panel: https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-panel
Base tag: epoch-1.9.0
Base commit: b5cc19e351b82eed999097ced1ff267d27bf8e7a

COSMIC Settings: https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-settings
Base tag: epoch-1.9.0
Base commit: 7421ff0ab482c942eef23fbe9280edacfbeb35cc

Modifications add a panel-colored gradient background, maximize/restore fades,
auto-hide support, adaptive geometry, and a per-profile setting in Settings.
The panel patch also keeps the inherited notification connection attempt alive
across timeouts to avoid reusing a closed file descriptor.

